      transEn: "Amid noisy contemporary life, the quiet seven-string Guqin is drawing a new generation of young learners. Its thirteen mother-of-pearl Hui inlays map exact harmonic physics, fostering calm focus through Jianzipu practice while studio acoustics and 3D models open classical Bayin heritage to modern public learning.",
